      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'History of the Game:

    Pokemon Red Version  (Pocket Monsters: Red)
    and Pokemon Green Version (Pocket Monsters: Green) are the first video games
    in the Pokemon series of games. They are the first primary paired versions of
    Generation I, developed by Game Freak and published by Nintendo for the handheld
    Game Boy. They were first released in Japan on February 27, 1996, and were later
    followed by the updated Pokemon Blue and the supplementary Pokemon Yellow. '
